   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "seit, vor and nach",
   "texto": [
    "**Seit** means «since» and is used with the present: **Ich wohne seit zwei Jahren hier** (I have lived here for two years).",
    "**Vor** means «does» in the past: **vor einer Woche** (a week ago). **Nach** means «after»: **nach dem Fest** (after the party). All three are asking for **dativo**."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "bei, ab and bis",
   "texto": [
    "**Bei** means «at the time of»: **bei der Feier** (in the celebration). **Ab** means «from»: **ab Freitag** (from Friday). **Bis** means «up» and with days goes without article: **bis Freitag** (until Friday).",
    "Eye with the false friend: **bei** does not mean «by», but «at the house of» or «at the time of»."
   ]
